\section{Design Specification}
\section{Project Pages and Modules}

\subsection{Home Dashboard}
Main landing page after login. Displays announcements, quick links, and role-based shortcuts.

\subsection{Role-Based Navigation}
Shows menu items based on the user's assigned role.

\subsection{Office Hoteling}
Allows staff to reserve shared office space or desks.

\subsection{Attorney Workload}
Tracks case distribution and workload information.

\subsection{Urgency Portal}
Displays restricted Power BI analytics for IT and supervisors.

\subsection{Expert Witness Directory}
Provides searchable expert witness contacts and availability status.

\subsection{Resource Library}
Provides manuals, procedure checklists, CDD guides, office documents, and training resources.

\subsection{Admin Maintenance Page}
Allows IT/admin users to maintain links, lists, permissions, and resource categories.

