\section{Docker Container Planning}
A full production SharePoint tenant cannot be fully reproduced in Docker, but Docker can document expected services and run placeholder support containers.

\begin{itemize}
\item frontend-dev: placeholder SPFx/Node environment.
\item mock-api: placeholder Graph/Azure/SharePoint simulation.
\item mock-db: PostgreSQL container for local testing.
\end{itemize}

